{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":33,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["主必拯救锡安"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你们这些毁灭别人、自己还未被毁灭的人有祸了！",{"text":"等你们毁灭完了，必毁灭你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这些欺诈别人、自己还未被欺诈的人有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等你们欺诈完了，必欺诈你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，求你施恩给我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们等候你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你每天早晨都作我们的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在艰难的时候拯救我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大喊一声，列邦都奔逃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你挺身而出，列国都溃散。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的战利品必被抢光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹如谷物被蝗虫吃光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们像蝗虫一样扑向战利品。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和华受尊崇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂住在高天之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必使锡安充满公平和公义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是你一生的保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你得到丰盛的救恩、智慧和知识。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敬畏耶和华是你的宝藏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"看啊，他们的勇士在街上哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求和的使者痛哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大路荒凉，行人绝迹。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"条约被废，城邑被弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人被藐视。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地枯竭衰残，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩的树木羞惭枯干，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙仑好像旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊和迦密的树叶凋零。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“现在我要起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要施展大能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要得到尊崇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们怀的是糠秕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生的是碎秸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的气息是烧灭自己的火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦必被烧成灰烬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像割下的荆棘被火焚烧。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"远方的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要听听我的作为。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"近处的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要承认我的大能。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安的罪人恐惧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不敬虔的人颤抖。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：“我们谁能与烈火同住？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能与永不止息的火焰同住？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"秉公行义、说话正直、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憎恶不义之财、摆手不受贿赂、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掩耳不听害人之谋、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"闭眼不看邪恶之事的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必住在高处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的堡垒是坚固的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必不会绝粮断水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必目睹君王的荣美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看到辽阔的土地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们心里必思想以往可怕的情景，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说：“登记的在哪里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收贡银的在哪里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"数城楼的在哪里？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们再也看不见那些残暴之徒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说话深奥难解，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们讲话奇怪难懂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们看我们在其中守节期的锡安城！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必看见耶路撒冷成为安宁之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是永不挪移的帐篷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"橛子永不拔出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"绳索也不会断。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那里，威严的耶和华必作保护我们的巨川大河。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摇桨的小舟不能驶入，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"威严的战船无法越过。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华是我们的审判官，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我们的立法者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我们的君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必拯救我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌人的帆索松开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桅杆晃动不稳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"风帆无法扬起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，大量战利品将被瓜分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至瘸腿的都分得一份。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷必没有居民说","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我生病了”，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城中百姓的罪恶必得到赦免。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/33.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/34.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/32.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":24}